sequenceDiagram
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Ledger as Package ledger

  API->>DB: Begin transaction and lock package account
  DB->>Ledger: Validate eligibility and available units
  Ledger-->>DB: Balance and rule snapshot
  DB->>Ledger: Append redemption hold
  DB->>DB: Update nonnegative balance projection
  DB-->>API: Commit hold
  API->>DB: Finalize paid booking
  DB->>Ledger: Convert hold to redemption
  Note over Ledger: No second decrement
  alt Checkout expires
    DB->>Ledger: Append hold release
  end
